{"id":"wb-7-5","name":"筛子绫罗遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"筛子绫罗遗址","text":"筛子绫罗遗址位于河北省张家口市蔚县下宫村公社筛子绫罗村东200米，属于新石器时代遗址，遗址面积为10万平方米。该遗址被中华人民共和国国务院列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%AD%9B%E5%AD%90%E7%BB%AB%E7%BD%97%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86784065,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86784065","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}